# HUQAN — MVP readiness backlog

Source: a live audit of main @ ea6466d run on 2026-08-19. Every claim below was
produced by running the surface, not by reading a doc. Ordered by evidence
gained per unit of work.

Status legend: [ ] open  [~] in progress  [x] done

---

