The code is done; the operator instructions are not. Four routes are mounted
through lib/a2a/routes.js and all four answer 404 today because
A2A_AUTHORITY_FILE and A2A_REPLAY_DIR are unset:
  POST /api/a2a/exchange
  GET  /.well-known/agent-card.json
  POST /api/a2a/negotiate
  GET  /api/a2a/tasks/{taskId}
Done. docs/a2a-deployment.md carries the authority file shape, the replay
directory contract, the path-safety rules, the workspace boundary and an
explicit non-claims section. test/a2a-deployment-smoke.test.js boots the real
server.js process and proves 404 unconfigured, agent card + accepted exchange
configured, and a refused replay. README repointed.

